THE ARTIFICIAL AGENT CONTAINMENT FACILITY (AACF)

A Formal Architecture for Revocable Agency, Multi-Agent Oversight, and Safe Autonomous Systems for Earth-Independent Operations

Research Draft v0.5

Author / Research Coordinator: Ouadi Maakoul
Research Program: For Humanity 4
Status: Foundational theoretical framework — literature-grounded, formally complete on core mechanisms, explicitly falsifiable

